.DS_Store

# Claude Code agent worktree scratch space
.claude/worktrees/

# Per-developer Claude Code settings. Local to whoever cloned this; never shared.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Agent scratch scripts (traces, probes, frame captures) live at the root while in use; never
# committed. And what they write: a measurement pass leaves scripts and the frames they captured
# side by side, and both are working notes. The design log is where the finding goes, and a script
# that proves itself is committed under its own name. Every extension, not a list of them: in
# dragon, when only .ts, .mjs and directories were covered, a probe's JSON output was committed by
# accident and sat at the root for two days.
scratch-*

# The dev server's feedback inbox: reports sent from `npm run dev` and the end-to-end suite
# (vite.config.ts). The hosted game's go to the inbox repository instead.
feedback-inbox/
